	measure 'Footer BvA' = "Source: AdventureWorksDW (MIT), re-dated; FY2026-28 budgets synthetic · FX Bank of Canada: P&L monthly avg, BS month end, budget prior-FY avg · Closed " & FORMAT ( [As Of Month], "mmm yyyy" ) & " · Under-budgeted = actual > 2x budget"
